msgstr "Each notification shows alone at the top center, with no island or bar, and goes away by itself"

msgid "La rueda cambia el volumen"
msgstr "The wheel changes the volume"

msgid "Vista en miniatura de las ventanas"
msgstr "Window thumbnails"

