msgstr "Task progress"

msgid "Descargas, copias… solo de las apps que lo publican (como en Dash to Dock)"
msgstr "Downloads, copies… only from apps that publish it (as in Dash to Dock)"

msgid "Mensajes sin leer en los íconos"
msgstr "Unread messages on the icons"

