msgstr "History of what was copied (text, links, colors and images). Super+V opens it from anywhere; "

msgid "mientras esté activo, Super+V deja de abrir las notificaciones (sigue Super+M)"
msgstr "while it is on, Super+V no longer opens the notifications (Super+M still does)"

msgid "Red, Bluetooth, modo de energía, luz nocturna, estilo oscuro, cafeína, volumen, captura, bloquear, apagar… "
msgstr "Network, Bluetooth, power mode, night light, dark style, caffeine, volume, screenshot, lock, power off… "

