msgstr "It goes away completely; its controls stay in the Settings button. Hot corners keep working"

msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "Monitor"

msgid "Con varios monitores, la isla vive en uno. Si ese monitor se desconecta, pasa al principal."
msgstr "With several monitors, the island lives on one. If that monitor is unplugged, it moves to the primary one."

